{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>For the prophecy</b> — a noun, and the sense is: the prophecy was from his own heart; Shemaiah spoke about me." "<b>Hired him</b> — the vav of Sanballat is in place of alef." "<b>Hired him</b> — a noun, and its sense is as previously mentioned: they gave his hire. And the first is closer."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:12.458711024Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}